{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21879770",
      "title": "Using Mapper Helpers",
      "lectureOrder": 221,
      "videoOrder": 194,
      "sourceHash": "0efa85fe672dda92547f7595c720e319e4d39805b80e44b6ef094c6f93c84b34",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 4.92,
          "en": "Now we know the core Vuex features,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.92,
          "end": 8.4,
          "en": "we'll see it in a more realistic app in a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.4,
          "end": 10.41,
          "en": "Before we go there though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.41,
          "end": 13.44,
          "en": "let's talk about a couple of utility features,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.44,
          "end": 17.48,
          "en": "which make our life as a developer a bit easier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.48,
          "end": 20.47,
          "en": "And let's start with mappers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.47,
          "end": 22.47,
          "en": "In the counter, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.47,
          "end": 26.8,
          "en": "we have this counter computed property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.8,
          "end": 27.7,
          "en": "where we in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.7,
          "end": 30.503,
          "en": "just access our final counter getter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.47,
          "end": 36.09,
          "en": "So we have this code here just to get access to our getter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.09,
          "end": 38.16,
          "en": "Now, this is obviously not a lot of code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.16,
          "end": 40.58,
          "en": "but we're not doing anything besides",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.58,
          "end": 43.18,
          "en": "drilling into our store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.18,
          "end": 44.25,
          "en": "This is not horrible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.25,
          "end": 46.21,
          "en": "But in case you're not happy with that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.21,
          "end": 48.92,
          "en": "Vuex has a helper which you can use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.92,
          "end": 51.55,
          "en": "You can import something from Vuex,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.55,
          "end": 56.363,
          "en": "and that something is a mapGetters function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.74,
          "end": 60.4,
          "en": "You can use it inside of this computed object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.4,
          "end": 63.94,
          "en": "Instead of defining a computed property on your own,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.94,
          "end": 66.77,
          "en": "you can call mapGetters here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.77,
          "end": 70.27,
          "en": "And this will return an object which you can then spread",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.27,
          "end": 72.61,
          "en": "with the free.spread operator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.61,
          "end": 75.543,
          "en": "into your computed property object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.4,
          "end": 80.05,
          "en": "So mapGetters gives you an object, which we now merge",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.05,
          "end": 82.07300000000001,
          "en": "into the computed properties object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.95,
          "end": 85.5,
          "en": "Because the object mapGetters will give you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.5,
          "end": 88.17,
          "en": "is an object full of computed properties,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.17,
          "end": 90.85300000000001,
          "en": "which are defined automatically for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.71000000000001,
          "end": 92.56,
          "en": "Well, now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.56,
          "end": 95.25,
          "en": "which computed properties do we get here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.25,
          "end": 98.56,
          "en": "Well, mapGetters takes an array as an argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.56,
          "end": 103.42,
          "en": "And in here, you list all getter names as strings,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.42,
          "end": 104.71000000000001,
          "en": "which you want to have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.71000000000001,
          "end": 107.47999999999999,
          "en": "as computed properties in this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.47999999999999,
          "end": 110.32,
          "en": "So in this case, for example, the final counter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.32,
          "end": 112.87,
          "en": "but of course, we could have multiple getters here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.74000000000001,
          "end": 115.97999999999999,
          "en": "And now this will give us a final counter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 115.97999999999999,
          "end": 118.36,
          "en": "computed property in this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 118.36,
          "end": 122.053,
          "en": "which automatically points at the finalCounter getter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 123.97,
          "end": 124.803,
          "en": "And with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 124.803,
          "end": 127.34,
          "en": "we just need to change this here to finalCounter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.34,
          "end": 130.29,
          "en": "because that will be the computed property name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 130.29,
          "end": 132.24,
          "en": "And then if we reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 132.24,
          "end": 134.37,
          "en": "it still works as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 134.37,
          "end": 136.12,
          "en": "But now with mapGetters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 136.12,
          "end": 138.5,
          "en": "especially when you use multiple getters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 138.5,
          "end": 139.86,
          "en": "in a given component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 139.86,
          "end": 141.98,
          "en": "you might be able to save some code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 141.98,
          "end": 145.973,
          "en": "and not drill unnecessarily into the store all the time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 147.66,
          "end": 151.37,
          "en": "Now, we have something similar for state and mutations,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 151.37,
          "end": 154.84,
          "en": "but you don't really use those in your components anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 154.84,
          "end": 157.32,
          "en": "So let's have a look at mapActions then,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 157.32,
          "end": 161.8,
          "en": "which also exists to mapActions into your components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 161.8,
          "end": 163.44,
          "en": "How does this look like?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 163.44,
          "end": 164.98,
          "en": "Let's say in change counter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 164.98,
          "end": 167.98,
          "en": "we don't manually want to define methods,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 167.98,
          "end": 170.95,
          "en": "which in the end also just drill into the store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 170.95,
          "end": 173.53300000000002,
          "en": "to dispatch some action here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 174.73,
          "end": 177.86,
          "en": "Instead, we could just as with getters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 177.86,
          "end": 182.09,
          "en": "import something from Vuex,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 182.09,
          "end": 185.62,
          "en": "and that something here is mapActions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 187.35,
          "end": 191.14,
          "en": "Now, just as with mapGetters we call mapActions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 191.14,
          "end": 193.59,
          "en": "Now inside of methods though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 193.59,
          "end": 195.16,
          "en": "not inside of computed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 195.16,
          "end": 197.11,
          "en": "but inside of methods.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 197.11,
          "end": 200.61,
          "en": "We call mapActions, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 200.61,
          "end": 203.84,
          "en": "And again get back an object which we merge",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 203.84,
          "end": 207.173,
          "en": "with the methods object by using the spread operator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 208.04,
          "end": 211.25,
          "en": "MapActions now also takes an array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 211.25,
          "end": 214.09,
          "en": "And now here we define all the action names,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 214.09,
          "end": 217.84,
          "en": "which we wanna have as methods in this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 217.84,
          "end": 219.82,
          "en": "So in this case, increment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 219.82,
          "end": 222.66,
          "en": "But of course, we could also add the increase action here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 222.66,
          "end": 226.82,
          "en": "to map both actions to methods in this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 226.82,
          "end": 230.31,
          "en": "And these methods will be created for you by mapActions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 230.31,
          "end": 232.163,
          "en": "That's the idea behind using it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 233.75,
          "end": 236.96,
          "en": "Now with that, we could add a second button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 236.96,
          "end": 240.3,
          "en": "and on the first button, call increment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 240.3,
          "end": 241.76,
          "en": "That's the name of the method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 241.76,
          "end": 245.09,
          "en": "which will be created for the increment action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 245.09,
          "end": 247.853,
          "en": "and point at increase on the second button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 248.75,
          "end": 251.47,
          "en": "Now, of course here we need a payload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 251.47,
          "end": 256.35,
          "en": "And you can simply pass your payload as an argument then.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 256.35,
          "end": 260.36,
          "en": "So in this case, an object with a value of 10.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 260.36,
          "end": 263.67,
          "en": "Because we expect a payload in our store,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 263.67,
          "end": 265.163,
          "en": "which will be an object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 266.03,
          "end": 268.68,
          "en": "which has a value property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 268.68,
          "end": 271.78,
          "en": "So that's why we pass an object with a value property here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 271.78,
          "end": 276.26,
          "en": "simply as an argument to this automatically created method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 276.26,
          "end": 279.35,
          "en": "With that, we can change this button caption",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 279.35,
          "end": 282.65,
          "en": "maybe to 11 to tell it apart from the other button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 282.65,
          "end": 284.05,
          "en": "also change the value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 284.05,
          "end": 285.9,
          "en": "And with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 285.9,
          "end": 289.2,
          "en": "now we got this new button, which also works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 289.2,
          "end": 291.51,
          "en": "So now we're also mapping actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 291.51,
          "end": 293.61,
          "en": "and this saves us the time to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 293.61,
          "end": 295.973,
          "en": "add to those methods on our own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 297.21,
          "end": 300.7,
          "en": "There also is an alternative way of mapping actions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 300.7,
          "end": 303.8,
          "en": "in case you're not happy with the default names,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 303.8,
          "end": 306.06,
          "en": "you can also call mapActions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 306.06,
          "end": 310.36,
          "en": "and not pass an array to it but an object instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 310.36,
          "end": 312.78,
          "en": "And then you can define the method names",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 312.78,
          "end": 316.92,
          "en": "you want to have in your component as keys.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 316.92,
          "end": 318.41,
          "en": "For example, inc,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 318.41,
          "end": 320.33,
          "en": "and then hold the action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 320.33,
          "end": 323.573,
          "en": "which should be mapped to this method as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 325.13,
          "end": 330.13,
          "en": "So with that, we could go with inc and increase like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 330.19,
          "end": 332.22,
          "en": "And with that, the increment action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 332.22,
          "end": 334.11,
          "en": "would be mapped to an inc method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 334.11,
          "end": 337.15999999999997,
          "en": "increase would be mapped to an increased method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 337.15999999999997,
          "end": 338.96,
          "en": "And therefore we would have to call",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 338.96,
          "end": 341.353,
          "en": "increment by calling inc now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 342.86,
          "end": 344.06,
          "en": "increase stays increase,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 344.06,
          "end": 346.51,
          "en": "because that's how I'm mapping it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 346.51,
          "end": 348.52,
          "en": "And with data of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 348.52,
          "end": 351.363,
          "en": "that would still work if we try this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 352.25,
          "end": 355.563,
          "en": "So mapActions and mapGetters can be very, very useful.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
